{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Twilight's Presence procs on periodic Shadow or Fire damage (#12629)",
  "contract": [
    "#12629: Twilight's Presence (proc dummies 202100, 312643, 316643, 320643) never procced. Every dummy carries",
    "Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no spell_proc row, so SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip:",
    "\"Dealing periodic Shadow or Fire damage\". Flags 262144 (done periodic) with SchoolMask 36 (Shadow and Fire),",
    "damage only. No cooldown in any tooltip. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded entry's chance, which equals",
    "the record's ProcChance, and spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown. aura_proc_rate replays the",
    "aura's native proc decision, including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic event per check. It procs on a",
    "periodic Shadow tick (Shadow Word: Pain 589), a periodic Fire tick (Immolate 348), at the record's chance;",
    "it never procs on a periodic Arcane tick (Moonfire 8921), a landed direct Fire spell (Fireball 133). Before",
    "the repair the chance and cooldown lookups fail with 'Spell has no proc entry' and every rate reads 0, so",
    "the discriminating checks fail instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "caster",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 80,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "dummy",
      "owner": "caster",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 80,
      "health": 1000000,
      "distance": 4
    }
  ],
